208 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 95 0 R/E(Many of the housing is in the form of mass apartment complexes. The apartment complexes seem to be made around the early 2000's or late 1900's. However, many houses are under renovation or already renovated. There is slight deterioration of housing and complexes. Many HVAC systems are external and are older models.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[11]>>
