210 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 95 0 R/E(In this area, there are numerous public transport stops for the METRO public transport. There are also stops outside major areas like churches, health clinics, and schools, In one specific area, there were roughly about  3 stops all in a 300 foot road. However, the road quality in specific areas are clearly deteriorated which can pose as a barrier for bicycles, walking, and even cars. )/Pg 13 0 R/K[13]>>
endobj

