212 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 95 0 R/E(In this zone appears to have 1 big recreational park for activity free and open to the public. Hangouts and gatherings are permitted in this area which reduce barriers for socialization in the community or physical activity. As for aesthetic appeal, the park is the only area in which there is an appeal. There is very little open green space for community residents.  )/Pg 13 0 R/K[15]>>
