254 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 97 0 R/E(Aside from the parks present in this area, there is a big harris health clinic that provides resources, primary and speciality care to those in this commuinty. There are at least 4 schools in the area with numerous buses and parking. )/Pg 15 0 R/K[11]>>
