<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 104 0 R/T(As future registered nurses, we learned to take into account how the social determinants of health affect both individual patients and the larger community. The survey strengthened our understanding of community assessment and showed how access to healthcare and local resources can support health equity. It also opens up our eyes to look at communities through a community nurse lense and not just objectively. Through this experience, we are able to really open our eyes up to thorough assessments of communities, resources, and what we can do to promote health, prevent disease, and restore health among individuals in their everyday environment. )/E(As future registered nurses, we learned to take into account how the social determinants of health affect both individual patients and the larger community. The survey strengthened our understanding of community assessment and showed how access to healthcare and local resources can support health equity. It also opens up our eyes to look at communities through a community nurse lense and not just objectively. Through this experience, we are able to really open our eyes up to thorough assessments of communities, resources, and what we can do to promote health, prevent disease, and restore health among individuals in their everyday environment. )/Pg 22 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

469 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 104 0 R/T(This experience also highlighted the role nurses play in identifying community health needs, advocating for access to services, promoting preventive care, and connecting individuals and families with resources that meet their needs)/E(This experience also highlighted the role nurses play in identifying community health needs, advocating for access to services, promoting preventive care, and connecting individuals and families with resources that meet their needs)/Pg 22 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

